an lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">부</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">졸업증명서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">부</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">-&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">선발 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">서류전형 및 면접심사</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">-&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">신청방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">이메일 접수 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">bangsan_kit@kumoh.ac.kr</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Dotum, 돋움, sans-serif; font-size